+### 5.4 Dialog store
+
+建议新增 `web/stores/useTerminalPathLinkStore.ts`，从 `web/stores/index.ts` 导出。
+
+状态至少包含：
+
+```ts
+type TerminalPathLinkDialogState =
+  | { phase: "closed" }
+  | {
+      phase: "resolving";
+      requestId: number;
+      sessionId: string;
+      rawPath: string;
